{"seq":3,"slug":"neural-audio-codecs","title":"神经音频编解码器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/speech-synthesis/foundations/neural-audio-codecs","wordCount":1406,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"神经音频编解码器\">神经音频编解码器</h1><p>2022 年 Meta 发布 EnCodec、Google 发布 SoundStream，标志着神经音频编解码器（Neural Audio Codec）从音频压缩工具跃升为语音生成系统的核心表示层。这些编解码器将连续波形压缩为离散 token 序列，使得 TTS 问题可以被重新定义为语言建模问题——VALL-E、Fish Speech、CosyVoice 等一切前沿模型都建立在这个基础之上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>神经音频编解码器</strong>：由编码器、量化器、解码器三段构成的端到端模型，把连续波形压缩为离散 token 序列，使 TTS 等价于语言建模</li>\n<li><strong>RVQ（残差向量量化）</strong>：逐层分解量化误差，每层只编码上一层的残差。层级结构天然实现信息粗细分离——第 1 层承载语义与说话人信息，后续层补充声学细节</li>\n<li><strong>语义 / 声学 Token 分离</strong>：语义 token 由自监督模型（HuBERT、w2v-BERT）聚类得到，声学 token 由 RVQ 编解码器产生，两者分离是当前两阶段 TTS 的基础</li>\n<li><strong>码率约束</strong>：TTS 场景使用 1.5-6 kbps 的超低码率，远低于传统音频编码的 64-320 kbps</li>\n<li><strong>三类训练损失</strong>：重建损失（波形 L1 + 多尺度 STFT）、对抗损失（多尺度判别器）、量化承诺损失，配合码本利用率正则防止坍塌</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"核心设计理念\">核心设计理念</h2><p>传统音频编码（MP3、Opus、AAC）使用心理声学模型丢弃人耳无法感知的信息。神经编解码器则让端到端神经网络自己学习什么该保留、什么该丢弃：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>编码器（Encoder）</strong>：将波形压缩为低维连续向量序列</li>\n<li><strong>量化器（Quantizer）</strong>：将连续向量离散化为码本索引</li>\n<li><strong>解码器（Decoder）</strong>：从离散码重建波形</li>\n</ol>\n<p>关键约束是<strong>码率（Bitrate）</strong>：越低的码率意味着越极端的压缩，但重建质量也随之下降。TTS 场景通常使用 1.5-6 kbps 的超低码率，远低于传统编码的 64-320 kbps。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[24kHz 波形] --&gt; B[卷积编码器&lt;br/&gt;下采样 320x]&#10;    B --&gt; C[75 Hz 连续向量]&#10;    C --&gt; D[RVQ 量化&lt;br/&gt;8 层码本]&#10;    D --&gt; E[离散 Token&lt;br/&gt;75 fps x 8 层]&#10;    E --&gt; F[卷积解码器&lt;br/&gt;上采样 320x]&#10;    F --&gt; G[重建波形 24kHz]\">flowchart LR\n    A[24kHz 波形] --&gt; B[卷积编码器&lt;br/&gt;下采样 320x]\n    B --&gt; C[75 Hz 连续向量]\n    C --&gt; D[RVQ 量化&lt;br/&gt;8 层码本]\n    D --&gt; E[离散 Token&lt;br/&gt;75 fps x 8 层]\n    E --&gt; F[卷积解码器&lt;br/&gt;上采样 320x]\n    F --&gt; G[重建波形 24kHz]</pre><h2 id=\"残差向量量化-rvq\">残差向量量化（RVQ）</h2><p>残差向量量化（Residual Vector Quantization）是神经编解码器的核心量化策略。它将量化误差逐层分解，每一层只需要编码上一层的残差：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">r</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">z</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>q</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>Q</mi></munderover><msub><mtext>VQ</mtext><mi>q</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">r</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">r</mi><mi>q</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">r</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mtext>VQ</mtext><mi>q</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">r</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{r}_0 = \\mathbf{z}, \\quad \\hat{\\mathbf{z}}_q = \\sum_{q=1}^{Q} \\text{VQ}_q(\\mathbf{r}_{q-1}), \\quad \\mathbf{r}_q = \\mathbf{r}_{q-1} - \\text{VQ}_q(\\mathbf{r}_{q-1})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5944em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.994em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">z</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7079em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">z</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0134em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.2787em;vertical-align:-1.4032em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8754em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8829em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3471em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">Q</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4032em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">VQ</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0573em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3802em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1302em;vertical-align:-0.3802em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">VQ</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0573em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3802em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{z}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">z</span></span></span></span></span> 是编码器输出，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 是量化层数（通常 4-8 层），每层码本大小通常为 1024 或 2048。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>编解码器</th>\n<th>码本层数</th>\n<th>码本大小</th>\n<th>帧率</th>\n<th>采样率</th>\n<th>码率</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>EnCodec</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>1024</td>\n<td>75 Hz</td>\n<td>24 kHz</td>\n<td>6 kbps</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SoundStream</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>1024</td>\n<td>50 Hz</td>\n<td>24 kHz</td>\n<td>6 kbps</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DAC (Descript)</td>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>1024</td>\n<td>86 Hz</td>\n<td>44.1 kHz</td>\n<td>8 kbps</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mimi (Kyutai)</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>2048</td>\n<td>12.5 Hz</td>\n<td>24 kHz</td>\n<td>1.1 kbps</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fish Codec (S2)</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>2048</td>\n<td>50 Hz</td>\n<td>44.1 kHz</td>\n<td>6 kbps</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>RVQ 的层级结构天然形成信息的粗细分离：第 1 层编码最粗粒度的语义和说话人信息，后续层逐步补充声学细节。这一特性被 TTS 模型充分利用——VALL-E 用 AR 模型生成第 1 层 token，用 NAR 模型并行生成其余层。</p>\n<h2 id=\"语义-token-与声学-token-的分离\">语义 Token 与声学 Token 的分离</h2><p>2023-2024 年的研究发现：将音频表示拆分为<strong>语义 token</strong>（capturing what is said）和<strong>声学 token</strong>（capturing how it sounds）能显著提升 TTS 质量。</p>\n<p><strong>语义 token</strong> 通常由自监督模型（HuBERT、w2v-BERT）的中间层表示经 K-means 聚类得到，帧率 25-50 Hz，编码语言内容和韵律结构。</p>\n<p><strong>声学 token</strong> 由 RVQ 编解码器产生，帧率 50-86 Hz，编码音色、音质等细粒度声学特征。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[原始波形] --&gt; B[HuBERT / w2v-BERT]&#10;    A --&gt; C[EnCodec / SoundStream]&#10;    B --&gt; D[语义 Token&lt;br/&gt;25-50 Hz&lt;br/&gt;内容 + 韵律]&#10;    C --&gt; E[声学 Token&lt;br/&gt;50-86 Hz&lt;br/&gt;音色 + 细节]&#10;    D --&gt; F[Stage 1: 文本到语义&lt;br/&gt;AR Language Model]&#10;    F --&gt; G[Stage 2: 语义到声学&lt;br/&gt;NAR / Flow Model]&#10;    G --&gt; H[Codec Decoder 波形]\">flowchart TD\n    A[原始波形] --&gt; B[HuBERT / w2v-BERT]\n    A --&gt; C[EnCodec / SoundStream]\n    B --&gt; D[语义 Token&lt;br/&gt;25-50 Hz&lt;br/&gt;内容 + 韵律]\n    C --&gt; E[声学 Token&lt;br/&gt;50-86 Hz&lt;br/&gt;音色 + 细节]\n    D --&gt; F[Stage 1: 文本到语义&lt;br/&gt;AR Language Model]\n    F --&gt; G[Stage 2: 语义到声学&lt;br/&gt;NAR / Flow Model]\n    G --&gt; H[Codec Decoder 波形]</pre><p>这种两阶段设计被 CosyVoice、SeedTTS、MaskGCT 等模型广泛采用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"训练目标与损失函数\">训练目标与损失函数</h2><p>神经编解码器的训练通常结合多个损失：</p>\n<p><strong>重建损失</strong>：时域波形 L1 + 多尺度 STFT 损失</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mtext>recon</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo>−</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>s</mi></munder><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><msub><mtext>STFT</mtext><mi>s</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mtext>STFT</mtext><mi>s</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{L}_{\\text{recon}} = \\|\\mathbf{x} - \\hat{\\mathbf{x}}\\|_1 + \\sum_{s} \\|\\text{STFT}_s(\\mathbf{x}) - \\text{STFT}_s(\\hat{\\mathbf{x}})\\|_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">recon</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7079em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0134em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.9em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.25em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">STFT</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">STFT</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7079em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0134em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>对抗损失</strong>：使用多尺度判别器（HiFi-GAN 风格的 MSD + MPD）推动生成质量</p>\n<p><strong>量化承诺损失</strong>：促使编码器输出靠近码本向量</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mtext>commit</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">z</mi><mo>−</mo><mtext>sg</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{L}_{\\text{commit}} = \\|\\mathbf{z} - \\text{sg}(\\hat{\\mathbf{z}})\\|_2^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">commit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sg</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7079em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">z</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0134em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>码本利用率</strong>：通过 EMA 更新或正则化防止码本坍塌（codebook collapse），确保所有码字都被使用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"2025-2026-前沿-超低帧率与语义增强\">2025-2026 前沿：超低帧率与语义增强</h2><p>最新的编解码器在两个方向持续突破：</p>\n<p><strong>超低帧率</strong>：Kyutai 的 Mimi 编解码器将帧率降至 12.5 Hz（每秒仅 12.5 个 token），极大缩短了语言模型需要生成的序列长度。这对流式 TTS 的首包延迟有直接帮助。</p>\n<p><strong>语义-声学联合训练</strong>：Fish Audio S2（2026）在编解码器训练阶段就引入语义监督信号，使得 RVQ 第一层自然携带丰富语义，无需额外的 HuBERT 提取步骤。</p>\n<p><strong>多分辨率码本</strong>：WavTokenizer、SpeechTokenizer 等工作探索非均匀帧率设计——元音段高分辨率、辅音段低分辨率——更贴合语音的信息密度分布。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>神经编解码器将波形转为离散 token，使 TTS 等价于语言建模</li>\n<li>RVQ 层级结构实现粗细信息分离，第 1 层 = 语义，后续层 = 声学细节</li>\n<li>语义/声学 token 分离是当前主流两阶段 TTS 的基础</li>\n<li>训练结合重建、对抗、承诺三类损失</li>\n<li>前沿方向：超低帧率（12.5 Hz）、语义增强编码、多分辨率码本</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"speech-signal-processing\">语音信号处理基础</a> —— 理解编解码器输入输出的物理含义</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../computer-vision-applied/generation/diffusion-models\">扩散模型</a> —— 声学 token 解码阶段常用的生成方法</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"神经音频编解码器","id":"神经音频编解码器"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"核心设计理念","id":"核心设计理念"},{"level":2,"text":"残差向量量化（RVQ）","id":"残差向量量化-rvq"},{"level":2,"text":"语义 Token 与声学 Token 的分离","id":"语义-token-与声学-token-的分离"},{"level":2,"text":"训练目标与损失函数","id":"训练目标与损失函数"},{"level":2,"text":"2025-2026 前沿：超低帧率与语义增强","id":"2025-2026-前沿-超低帧率与语义增强"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"声学模型演进：从拼接式到端到端","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/speech-synthesis/foundations/acoustic-models-evolution"},"next":{"title":"自回归语音合成模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/speech-synthesis/models/autoregressive-tts"}}